  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the butter and milk to potato and season with salt. Mash until smooth. TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a997d66952abc98739939b-df216630.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, preheat grill to high.\n• Finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a997d66952abc98739939b-481fca0e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook sliced mushrooms, stirring, until slightly browned and softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add carrot and onion and cook, until tender, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a997d66952abc98739939b-ed9528c6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add cannellini beans, garlic, herb & mushroom seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil to pan, then cook, stirring until fragrant and slightly tender, 2 minutes.\n• Stir in light cooking cream, the water and vegetable stock powder and simmer, until slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove from heat, add baby spinach leaves, stirring, until wilted. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a997d66952abc98739939b-5fd98250.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer mushroom filling into a baking dish and evenly spread mashed potato over the top. Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.\n• Grill until lightly golden, 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a997d66952abc98739939b-c0efb91e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy mushroom, white bean and herb pie between plates.\n• Sprinkle with a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66a997d66952abc98739939b-7f69e669.jpeg"
    }
  ]
